{
  "id": 8867180118215,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 21",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-21",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a personalized haven with this unique Jeminise bedding set. Crafted for comfort and designed with a spirited baseball theme, this comforter set is perfect for baseball enthusiasts and makes a thoughtful, customizable gift for any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for baseball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating determination and passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing Process:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques that ensure vibrant colors resist fading for years to come, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric, offering a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel for a restful sleep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Microfiber Filling:</strong> Contains whole-piece microfiber filling with tight stitching to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat, allowing microfiber to dry quickly and become fluffier.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with up to two text inputs, making this bedding set uniquely yours.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
